               ╭ Keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
               │                                                                                        │
               │ Ctrl+P            Command palette          J                 Results as JSON / grid    │
               │ F5 Ctrl+E         Run statement/selection  o                 Add a row                 │
               │ Shift+F5          Run the whole script     x                 Export rows to a file     │
               │ Ctrl+Space        Suggest names            >                 Widen column              │
               │ Ctrl+R            Query history            s                 Sort by column            │
               │ Ctrl+N            New query tab            <                 Narrow column             │
               │ Ctrl+W            Close query tab          Tab               Next panel                │
               │ Alt+] Ctrl+PgDn   Next query tab           Shift+Tab         Previous panel            │
               │ Alt+[ Ctrl+PgUp   Previous query tab       /                 Filter                    │
               │ Ctrl+C            Copy / cancel query      R                 Refresh                   │
               │ Ctrl+X            Cut                      n                 New connection            │
               │ Ctrl+V            Paste                    e                 Edit / definition         │
               │ Ctrl+Z            Undo                     Delete d          Delete                    │
               │ Ctrl+Y            Redo                     Ctrl+S            Save                      │
               │ Ctrl+A            Select all               F1                Connection list           │
               │ Shift+←           Select left              K                 Kubernetes clusters       │
               │ Shift+→           Select right             Ctrl+T            Next theme                │
               │ Shift+↑           Select up                F12               Event log                 │
               │ Shift+↓           Select down              Space             Command menu              │
               │ Shift+Home        Select to line start     ? F2              Show keys                 │
               │ Shift+End         Select to line end       Esc               Back / close              │
               │ Alt+Shift+←       Select previous word     q Ctrl+Q          Quit                      │
               │ Alt+Shift+→       Select next word         Enter             Select / new line         │
               │ Ctrl+L            Select the line          ↑                 Up                        │
               │ Alt+B Alt+←       Previous word            ↓                 Down                      │
               │ Alt+F Alt+→       Next word                ←                 Left / previous column    │
               │ Backspace         Delete back              →                 Right / next column       │
               │ Alt+Backspace     Delete a word            PgUp              Page up                   │
               │ y                 Copy as CSV, JSON, …     PgDn              Page down                 │
               │ V                 Select whole rows        Home              First row / line start    │
               │ i                 Inspect / insert name    End               Last row / line end       │
               │                                                                                        │
               ╰────────────────── ↑↓←→ move · Enter change · Del default · Esc close ──────────────────╯
